  title: B O N   V O Y A G E
  button: BON VOYAGE
  riddle: A map, a passport, two boarding passes, two luggage tags, sunglasses, a
    camera, a cap, a compass and a toothbrush. Time to leave.
  hint: 'It flies to the right: the cap is the nose, the sunglasses a propeller,
    the boarding passes the body and wing, and the map, passport and a tag the tail.'
  complete: 'BON VOYAGE

    Window seat, please.'
